{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13208010","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13208010","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1320801001:1":{"text":"博尔！博尔——！！！","source_cn":"博尔！博尔——！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB899DD0E6DF4B93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320801002:1":{"text":"我在这里！不要一遍遍叫我名字，你就不能把想说的先说出来吗？","source_cn":"我在这里！不要一遍遍叫我名字，你就不能把想说的先说出来吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13AD7DB329ED2CF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320801003:1":{"text":"这是流程！我必须先确保你在听我讲话！我们要不要再去确认下其他采冰区的情况？","source_cn":"这是流程！我必须先确保你在听我讲话！我们要不要再去确认...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB499F00C3F3C06B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320801004:1":{"text":"不，遇到意外不能擅离工作区，这是规定！","source_cn":"不，遇到意外不能擅离工作区，这是规定！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37D3B82E3519E405","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1320801004":{"text":"不，遇到意外不能擅离工作区，这是规定！","source_cn":"不，遇到意外不能擅离工作区，这是规定！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37D3B82E3519E405","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320801005:1":{"text":"麻烦！天大的麻烦！","source_cn":"麻烦！天大的麻烦！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA4CC13455959B477","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"麻烦！天大的麻烦！","female":"麻烦！天大的麻烦！","variant_male_record_index":"146366","variant_female_record_index":"146367","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320801007:1":{"text":"我们被指派来挖冰块制作冰雕，但指定区域的坚冰已经被采过了。","source_cn":"我们被指派来挖冰块制作冰雕，但指定区域的坚冰已经被采过了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4889A2E465BA3E8F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"我们被指派来挖冰块制作冰雕，但指定区域的坚冰已经被采过了。","female":"我们被指派来挖冰块制作冰雕，但指定区域的坚冰已经被采过了。","variant_male_record_index":"146370","variant_female_record_index":"146371","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320801008:1":{"text":"你没说清楚最糟糕的，那就是冰雕已经完成了！我还等着交付后悠闲地喝几口热羊奶呢！这下全乱套了！","source_cn":"你没说清楚最糟糕的，那就是冰雕已经完成了！我还等着交付...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC609D4204E4ABC38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320801009:1":{"text":"冰雕……你们是说庆典上最后要用的冰雕？","source_cn":"冰雕……你们是说庆典上最后要用的冰雕？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5A4C7962EA45021","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320801010:1":{"text":"不然还有哪个？我们好不容易改进了制作工艺，优化流程，准备让最终成品超越往期。结果到地方一看，雕像竟然已经做完了！","source_cn":"不然还有哪个？我们好不容易改进了制作工艺，优化流程，准...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD13D46F2755229BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320801011:1":{"text":"呃……这不是好事吗？你们的工作已经完成，不用再赶工了。","source_cn":"呃……这不是好事吗？你们的工作已经完成，不用再赶工了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F7F1E9468527709","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320801012:1":{"text":"什么？！这绝不可以！","source_cn":"什么？！这绝不可以！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7A899635E671D68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320801013:1":{"text":"为什么？","source_cn":"为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0D53EED0F2F225F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320801014:1":{"text":"本来没有做完的东西，现在却做完了，这是难以忍受的巨大纰漏！必须排除流程中哪一环出了问题，不然后面可能会错上加错。","source_cn":"本来没有做完的东西，现在却做完了，这是难以忍受的巨大纰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x985F986A8771E323","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320801015:1":{"text":"施工记录是不可能出错的，我们没有完成雕像的书面记录，记忆更是不可靠。当然要相信更合规的那一个！","source_cn":"施工记录是不可能出错的，我们没有完成雕像的书面记录，记...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36DC0EE8F029A5FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","